#: app/htmx/static_routes.py:140
msgid "Not found."
msgstr "غير موجود."

#: app/htmx/static_routes.py:143
msgid ""
"The task planner has not been built. Run `just build planner`, or set "
"PLANNER_DIR to the planner build directory."
msgstr ""
"لم يتم بناء مخطِّط المهام. شغّل `just build planner`، أو اضبط PLANNER_DIR"
" على مجلد بناء المخطِّط."

#: app/htmx/task_plan_routes.py:62
